#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:352
#, kde-format
msgid "Spam"
msgstr "Neželjenu poštu"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:380 common/antispamwizard.cpp:382
#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:577
#, kde-format
msgid "Classify as NOT Spam"
msgstr "Razvrstaj kao NE Neželjenu poštu"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:391
#, kde-format
msgid "Ham"
msgstr "Poželjna pošta"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:457
#, kde-format
msgid "Scanning for %1…"
msgstr "Skeniranje za %1…"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:501
#, kde-format
msgid "Scanning for anti-spam tools finished."
msgstr "Skeniranje za zaštita od neželjene pošte alate završeno."

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:501
#, kde-format
msgid "Scanning for anti-virus tools finished."
msgstr "Skeniranje za antivirusnih alate završeno."

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:503
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Sorry, no spam detection tools have been found. Install your spam "
"detection software and re-run this wizard.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Sorry, nema neželjenu poštu detection alate ima bio pronađena. Instalirajte vaš neželjenu poštu detection softver i re-run ovaj čarobnjak.</p>"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:506
#, kde-format
msgid "Scanning complete. No anti-virus tools found."
msgstr "Skeniranje završeno. Nema antivirusnih alate pronađena."

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:528
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Messages classified as spam are marked as read.<br />Spam messages are "
"moved into the folder named <i>%1</i>.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Messages razvrstane kao neželjenu poštu su označi kao pročitano.<br />Spam poruke su premješten inu mapu naziva <i>%1</i>.</p>"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:533
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Messages classified as spam are marked as read.<br />Spam messages are "
"not moved into a certain folder.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Messages razvrstane kao neželjenu poštu su označi kao pročitano.<br />Spam poruke su ne premješten u a određenu mapu.</p>"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:539
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Messages classified as spam are not marked as read.<br />Spam messages "
"are moved into the folder named <i>%1</i>.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Messages razvrstane kao neželjenu poštu su ne označi kao pročitano.<br />Spam poruke su premješten inu mapu naziva <i>%1</i>.</p>"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:544
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Messages classified as spam are not marked as read.<br />Spam messages "
"are not moved into a certain folder.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Messages razvrstane kao neželjenu poštu su ne označi kao pročitano.<br />Spam poruke su ne premješten u a određenu mapu.</p>"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:571
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>The folder for messages classified as unsure (probably spam) is <i>%1</i>."
"</p>"
msgstr "<p>The mapu za poruke razvrstane kao nesigurno (probably neželjenu poštu) je <i>%1</i>.</p>"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:581
#, kde-format
msgid "<p>The wizard will create the following filters:<ul>%1</ul></p>"
msgstr "<p>The čarobnjak će izradi the sljedeći filtre:<ul>%1</ul></p>"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:584
#, kde-format
msgid "<p>The wizard will replace the following filters:<ul>%1</ul></p>"
msgstr "<p>The čarobnjak će zamijeni the sljedeći filtre:<ul>%1</ul></p>"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:981
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The wizard will search for any tools to do spam detection\n"
"and setup KMail to work with them."
msgstr "The čarobnjak će pretraži za any alate to do neželjenu poštu detection\ni postaviti KMail to raditi sm."

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:983
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Here you can get some assistance in setting up KMail's filter rules to "
"use some commonly-known anti-virus tools.</p><p>The wizard can detect those "
"tools on your computer as well as create filter rules to classify messages "
"using these tools and to separate messages containing viruses. The wizard "
"will not take any existing filter rules into consideration: it will always "
"append the new rules.</p><p><b>Warning:</b> As KMail appears to be frozen "
"during the scan of the messages for viruses, you may encounter problems with "
"the responsiveness of KMail because anti-virus tool operations are usually "
"time consuming; please consider deleting the filter rules created by the "
"wizard to get back to the former behavior.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Here vi može dohvati neki pomoć u postavljanju gore KMail's filtarska pravila to koristi neki općepoznate antivirusnih alate.</p><p>The čarobnjak može otkriti oni alate na vaš računalu kao well kao izradi filtarska pravila to razvrstaj poruke korištenje ovi alate i to izdvojiti poruke containing viruses. The čarobnjak će ne take any postojeći filtarska pravila u consideration: to će always append the novi pravila.</p><p><b>Warning:</b> Kao KMail izgleda to biti zamrznut tijekom the skeniranja od poruke za viruses, vi možda naići probleme s odzivom od KMail jer antivirusnih alat operacije su obično vrijeme zahtjevne; molimo razmislite brisanja the filtarska pravila izrađen od the čarobnjak to dohvati back u former ponašanje.</p>"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:1033
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Please select the tools to be used for the detection and go to the next "
"page.</p>"
msgstr "<p>Odaberite the alate to biti koriste za detection i go u sljedeću stranicu.</p>"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:1057
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "&Mark detected spam messages as read"
msgstr "&Označi otkrivene neželjenu poštu poruke kao pročitano"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:1058
#, kde-format
msgid "Mark messages which have been classified as spam as read."
msgstr "Označi poruke koje ima bio razvrstane kao neželjenu poštu kao pročitano."

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:1061
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Move &known spam to:"
msgstr "Premjesti &poznatu neželjenu poštu to:"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:1063
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The default folder for spam messages is the trash folder, but you may change "
"that in the folder view below."
msgstr "The zadana mapu za neželjenu poštu poruke je the smeća mapu, but vi možda promijeniti taj u mapu prikaži ispod."

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:1076
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Move &probable spam to:"
msgstr "Premjesti &vjerojatnu neželjenu poštu to:"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:1078
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"The default folder is the inbox folder, but you may change that in the "
"folder view below.<p>Not all tools support a classification as unsure. If "
"you have not selected a capable tool, you cannot select a folder as well.</p>"
msgstr "The zadana mapu je the ulazna pošta mapu, but vi možda promijeniti taj u mapu prikaži ispod.<p>Not sve alate podršku a razvrstavanje kao nesigurno. Ako vi ima ne odabranog a odgovarajući alat, vi nije moguće odabrati a mapu kao well.</p>"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:1188
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Check messages using the anti-virus tools"
msgstr "Provjeri poruke korištenje the antivirusnih alate"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:1190
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Let the anti-virus tools check your messages. The wizard will create "
"appropriate filters. The messages are usually marked by the tools so that "
"following filters can react on this and, for example, move virus messages to "
"a special folder."
msgstr "Let the antivirusnih alate provjeravati vaš poruke. The čarobnjak će izradi odgovarajuće filtre. The poruke su obično označi od the alate so taj sljedeći filtre može reagirati na ovaj i, za primjerice, premjesti virusa poruke to a posebne mapu."

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:1196
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Move detected viral messages to the selected folder"
msgstr "Premjesti otkrivene zaražen poruke u odabranog mapu"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:1198
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"A filter to detect messages classified as virus-infected and to move those "
"messages into a predefined folder is created. The default folder is the "
"trash folder, but you may change that in the folder view."
msgstr "A filtarska to otkriti poruke razvrstane kao zaražen virusom i to premjesti oni poruke u a predefined mapu je izrađen. The zadana mapu je the smeća mapu, but vi možda promijeniti taj u mapu prikaži."

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:1204
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Additionally, mark detected viral messages as read"
msgstr "Dodatno, označi otkrivene zaražen poruke kao pročitano"

#: common/antispamwizard.cpp:1207
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Mark messages which have been classified as virus-infected as read, as well "
"as moving them to the selected folder."
msgstr "Označi poruke koje ima bio razvrstane kao zaražen virusom kao pročitano, kao well kao moving them u odabranog mapu."

